import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const f=JSON.parse('{"title":"Chapter 105 | Realm Refinement · Sense-Origin Realm · Breakthrough Risks, Costs, and Alaya Network Supervision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Chapter 105 | Realm Refinement · Sense-Origin Realm · Breakthrough Risks, Costs, and Alaya Network Supervision","no":105,"module":1,"tags":["境界","感元境","突破风险","代价","阿赖耶监管"],"related":["14-修炼境界统一划分","19-修炼伦理与边界","04-掠夺式修炼体系批判","97-监管机制总览","17-求道模拟机制","90-万族风险清单"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md","filePath":"en/105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"}'),s={name:"en/105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"};function r(n,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="chapter-105-sense-origin-realm-breakthrough-risks-costs-and-alaya-network-supervision" tabindex="-1">Chapter 105 | Sense-Origin Realm: Breakthrough Risks, Costs, and Alaya Network Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#chapter-105-sense-origin-realm-breakthrough-risks-costs-and-alaya-network-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Chapter 105 | Sense-Origin Realm: Breakthrough Risks, Costs, and Alaya Network Supervision&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module One · Deep Realm Refinement | Grounding documents: Docs 14, 19, 04, 97, 17, 90</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-ascension-has-a-price-and-the-price-must-be-a-causal-one" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Ascension Has a Price, and the Price Must Be a Causal One <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-ascension-has-a-price-and-the-price-must-be-a-causal-one" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Ascension Has a Price, and the Price Must Be a Causal One&quot;">​</a></h2><p>No cultivation system can promise a free lunch, and Heng Yuan Zhou is no exception. The Sense-Origin Realm is the starting point of a cultivator&#39;s life, yet it is precisely where the first divergence happens: some people&#39;s first breakthrough brings clarity, while some people&#39;s first breakthrough seeds madness. The predatory faction treats this divergence as &quot;natural elimination&quot;—the weak are supposed to die; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization treats it as a systemic problem: risk must be managed, costs must be transparent, and supervision must be layered.</p><p>This article unfolds the four core risks of Sense-Origin cultivation, the honest cost of breakthrough, and the five-layer supervision mechanism of the Alaya Network.</p><p>The Six Top Axioms provide the supervisory foundation: the Axiom of Anti-Predation—risk control must not become a new predation, that is, exploiting the weak&#39;s fear to harvest them; the Axiom of Myriad Races Republic—supervision applies equally to all races, no &quot;noble&quot; race exempt from risk; the Axiom of Collective Dimensional Ascension—an individual&#39;s breakdown is a loss to the whole, so early warning is duty, not kindness; the Axiom of Causal Self-Discipline—the cost of breakthrough must be the cultivator&#39;s own causal fruit, must not be transferred to surface beings; the Axiom of Law Priority—the supervisory framework of the Alaya Network is stable and self-consistent, never retconned for plot convenience, and can expand infinitely without collapsing. The Law of Universal Infinite Equality for All Beings establishes that every being inherently carries Fundamental Infinite Power; the laid-back retain a guaranteed baseline infinity and will not be eliminated by the times, while grinders and peerless youths can stack higher tiers of infinity. Infinite origin is carried by all; the weak falling in breakthrough is not &quot;just,&quot; but the failure of the supervisory system.</p><h2 id="i-four-core-risks-of-sense-origin-cultivation" tabindex="-1">I. Four Core Risks of Sense-Origin Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-core-risks-of-sense-origin-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Core Risks of Sense-Origin Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Perception chaos risk: energy surges are misjudged, the cultivator mistakes external noise for inner voice, opening the door to illusion—this is the earliest risk at the Sense-Origin Realm.</li><li>Foundation-dry risk: absorption outpaces digestion, the foundation layer is stuffed with unrefined energy, and the Congealing-Origin Realm ahead becomes a powder keg.</li><li>Ego-fanaticism risk: a first breakthrough gives an inflated sense of &quot;chosen one,&quot; the cultivator confuses himself with the path, and the Shortcut Inner Demon of Universal Origin Greed is born.</li><li>Causal leakage risk: premature borrowing of future potential, overdrawing later-stage growth for early-stage speed—this is the risk the old system most liked to encourage.</li></ol><p>These four risks are not uncommon accidents; they are the standard profile of Sense-Origin Realm breakthroughs. Pretending they do not exist is the first evil of the predatory system.</p><h2 id="ii-the-honest-cost-of-breakthrough" tabindex="-1">II. The Honest Cost of Breakthrough <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-honest-cost-of-breakthrough" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Honest Cost of Breakthrough&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s attitude toward breakthrough cost is &quot;truth first&quot;:</p><ul><li>Physical cost: the consumption and wear of the body, openly listed in the Output-Linked Contract System&#39;s ledger.</li><li>Time cost: the true duration of absorption, no &quot;hundredfold speed&quot; lies.</li><li>Causal cost: the karmic debt a breakthrough may incur, the Alaya Network records and traces it.</li><li>Opportunity cost: a detour is still a detour, and the extended-setting suggestion list (Doc 98) explicitly rejects &quot;pretending a detour is a shortcut.&quot;</li></ul><p>The predatory faction sells breakthroughs as free gifts—until the day the bill comes. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization lets every cultivator see the bill before paying: this is &quot;Axiom of Causal Self-Discipline&quot; at the entry level.</p><h2 id="iii-the-five-layer-supervision-mechanism-of-the-alaya-network" tabindex="-1">III. The Five-Layer Supervision Mechanism of the Alaya Network <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-five-layer-supervision-mechanism-of-the-alaya-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Five-Layer Supervision Mechanism of the Alaya Network&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Alaya Network (Doc 19&#39;s ethical anchor, Doc 97&#39;s supervision overview) does not replace cultivation, but stands beside it:</p><ul><li>Layer one · Perception monitoring: energy fluctuation anomalies are sensed, early warnings issued before chaos.</li><li>Layer two · Foundation audit: absorption quality is scored, and &quot;overfilled but not digested&quot; foundations get a red flag.</li><li>Layer three · Ego-early-warning: the &quot;chosen-one&quot; delusion pattern is recognized, and the peerless youth dual-route (Doc 102) pulls them back in time.</li><li>Layer four · Causal ledger: every breakthrough&#39;s cost and debt is recorded, traceable at any time.</li><li>Layer five · Rescue and retreat: a cultivator on the edge of breakdown can retreat to the safe zone; retreat is not failure, but a rational choice.</li></ul><p>These five layers are not a prison, but a guardrail—they stand the same whether the cultivator is speeding fast or crawling slow.</p><h2 id="iv-six-cultivation-ethics-landing-points" tabindex="-1">IV. Six Cultivation Ethics Landing Points <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-six-cultivation-ethics-landing-points" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Six Cultivation Ethics Landing Points&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Combined with the cultivation ethics and boundaries of Doc 19, Sense-Origin cultivation ethics land as six points:</p><ol><li>No predatory absorption—energy only from the world cycle, never from the lives of others.</li><li>No concealment of cost—the bill is shown before the price.</li><li>No forced breakthrough—retreat is an inalienable right.</li><li>No exploitation of fear—risk control may not harvest the fearful.</li><li>No &quot;chosen one&quot; monopoly—the path is open to everyone.</li><li>No abandonment of the fallen—a breakdown is a systemic alarm, not a verdict of worthlessness.</li></ol><h2 id="v-comparison-two-attitudes-toward-the-weak-breaking-down" tabindex="-1">V. Comparison: Two Attitudes Toward the Weak Breaking Down <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-comparison-two-attitudes-toward-the-weak-breaking-down" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Comparison: Two Attitudes Toward the Weak Breaking Down&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory attitude: &quot;the weak deserve to die,&quot; risk is a filter, and supervision is only for the strong&#39;s convenience.</li><li>Symbiotic attitude: &quot;the weak falling is our failure,&quot; risk is a problem to solve, and supervision is for everyone&#39;s safety.</li><li>The predatory faction&#39;s safety net protects only the strong&#39;s seat; the symbiotic faction&#39;s guardrail protects everyone&#39;s way home.</li></ul><p>This is the root difference between &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; and &quot;not one left behind.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Sense-Origin Realm is where a cultivator first touches risk. In Heng Yuan Zhou, touching risk does not mean &quot;you either become god or become monster,&quot; but &quot;we see you, we warn you, and you can always choose to step back.&quot; A cultivation system&#39;s goodness is not measured by how high its ceiling climbs, but by how it treats the first step—because that is where every cultivator started.</p><h2 id="links" tabindex="-1">Links <a class="header-anchor" href="#links" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Links&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分">14-Unified Classification of Cultivation Realms</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./04-掠夺式修炼体系批判">04-Critique of the Predatory Cultivation System</a> · <a href="./97-监管机制总览">97-Supervision Mechanism Overview</a> · <a href="./17-求道模拟机制">17-The Way-Seeking Simulation Mechanism</a> · <a href="./90-万族风险清单">90-Myriad Races Risk List</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=t(s,[["render",r]]);export{f as __pageData,p as default};
